Package: bms-bridge
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
         bluez
Description: BLE-to-RS485 bridge between a JK BMS and a Pylontech-speaking inverter
 bms_bridge connects to a JK BMS over Bluetooth Low Energy, parses the live
 cell / pack telemetry and the configured protection limits, then masquerades
 as a Pylontech V3.3 battery rack on RS485 so a hybrid inverter sees the real
 BMS data. Large packs are automatically exposed as multiple virtual modules
 so capacities beyond a single module's u16 mAh field still fit the protocol.
